hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne parda uthaya jabke log Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke peeche safen bandhe hue the, phir farmaya: 'Khabardar, beshak mujhe ruku ya sajde mein [Quran] padhne se mana kiya gaya hai. Raha ruku, to us mein Rabb ki azmat bayan karo [tasbeeh se]; aur raha sajda, to us mein dua mein koshish karo, kyunke [woh waqt] is laiq hai ke tumhare liye qabool kiya jae.'"
"160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qassi [reshmi kapde] pahenne, usfur [peele rang] se range kapde pahenne, sone ki anguthi pahenne, aur ruku mein Quran padhne se mana farmaya."
"161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, aur main nahin kehta ke tumhen mana farmaya, ke main ruku ya sajde mein Quran padhun, aur sone ki anguthi pahnun."
"162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab imam aameen kahe to tum bhi aameen kaho; kyunke farishte bhi aameen kehte hain. To jis ki aameen farishton ki aameen se mil jae, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab imam aameen kahe to tum bhi aameen kaho; kyunke jo apni aameen farishton ki aameen se milae, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab imam ﴿غَيْرِ الْمَغْضُوبِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا الضَّالِّينَ﴾ kahe to tum kaho: Aameen; kyunke jo apna qaul farishton ke qaul se milae, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi kahe: Aameen, aur aasman mein farishte kahen: Aameen, phir ek dusre se mil jae, to us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab imam kahe: Sami'allahu liman hamidah [Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne Us ki hamd ki], to tum kaho: Allahumma Rabbana lakal-hamd [Ai Allah, ai hamare Rabb, Tere liye hamd hai]; kyunke jo apni [aameen] farishton ki [aameen] se milae, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
